# yohannmarguier/IMAS-MATLAB develop: shim linkage, the two MEX linkage tests
# and the test runtime environment.
#
# First line is the full commit the MATLAB HLI validation job builds, read the
# way CMakeLists.txt reads IMAS_CORE_VERSION with LIMIT_COUNT 1; everything
# below it is commentary. A full SHA rather than a branch, so a moved HLI shows
# up as a one-line diff in the same pull request and a red job stays
# attributable.
#
# The repository name lives in the workflow rather than here because it is not
# the part that moves. Upstream IMAS-MATLAB carries no AL_USE_MULTIVERSION_SHIM
# option, so the fork is not a convenience.
#
# To move the pin: check that the fork commit still builds with
# AL_USE_MULTIVERSION_SHIM=ON and DD_VERSION=4.1.1, then update the first line
# and recalibrate MATLAB_TOTAL_TESTS in the workflow against what it registers.
